      "exact_reserve_text": "The table below shows changes in the insurance contract liabilities and assets from the beginning of the period to the end of the period. ... Change in estimates of prior year provisions Gross provisions (78,675) Reinsurance assets 62,733 Net (15,942). The change in claims outstanding includes the impact of release of net reserves for claims incurred on the prior years of GBP 15.9m (2023: strengthening of GBP 80.4m). These net reserve movements are stated net of the protection provided by the LPT.",
